{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SuperwallKit"}],"role":"symbol","title":"devServer","externalID":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9devServerAC03DevE0OSgvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"devServer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9DevServerO","text":"DevServer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/devServer-swift.property","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Connects this SDK instance to a running "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superwall dev"},{"type":"text","text":" server, for development builds only."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@nonobjc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"devServer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9DevServerO","text":"DevServer","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paywalls with a local counterpart on the dev server then render from your live, local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paywall code instead of their published versions, while configuration, placements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"audience evaluation, assignment and the enforcement of feature gating all stay real."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Paywalls without a local counterpart still load their published versions."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the local surface owns is what it renders and the settings its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"config.ts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declares: content, products, presentation style, feature gating, intro offer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"eligibility, scrolling and background colours all come from your local code, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changing them shows on the next presentation without a push. What "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"config.ts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot express — surveys, computed properties — comes from the published paywall"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the surface stands in for, and so does any setting your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"config.ts"},{"type":"text","text":" leaves out."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A dev server older than this SDK sends no settings at all, in which case every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"setting comes from the published paywall."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two exceptions. Local notifications are always the local paywall’s: the published"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ones are ignored and the ones your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"config.ts"},{"type":"text","text":" declares fire without a push, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they reach the SDK from the paywall itself rather than from the dashboard. And the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on-device cache stays off however either side configures it, so a page you are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing is never served from the web view’s cache."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/default","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on a simulator; on a physical device use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/url(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Device"},{"type":"text","text":" URL that "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superwall dev"},{"type":"text","text":" prints. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":": no dev server."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dev server also activates test mode (simulated purchases, product data from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dashboard), disables paywall preloading, and skips the test mode intro sheet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The host app must allow local networking in its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSAppTransportSecurity"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSAllowsLocalNetworking"},{"type":"text","text":"). That one key covers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every address "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superwall dev"},{"type":"text","text":" prints: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localhost"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".local"},{"type":"text","text":" hosts, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plain IP address in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Device"},{"type":"text","text":" URL, which App Transport Security stopped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"permitting by default in iOS 17."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.property"]}],"references":{"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/devServer-swift.property":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/devServer-swift.property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"devServer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9DevServerO","text":"DevServer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"devServer","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Connects this SDK instance to a running "},{"code":"superwall dev","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" server, for development builds only."}],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.property","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuperwallOptions","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SuperwallOptions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Options for configuring Superwall, including paywall presentation and appearance."}],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SuperwallOptions","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","title":"SuperwallKit","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/DevServer-swift.enum":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DevServer","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SuperwallOptions.DevServer","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A running "},{"code":"superwall dev","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" server for "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/devServer-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to connect to."}],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.enum","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DevServer","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/DevServer-swift.enum/default":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/default","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"`default`","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SuperwallOptions.DevServer.default","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Finds the dev server on "},{"code":"localhost","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ports 6100–6104, which reaches a server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"running on the same machine from a simulator."}],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.enum\/default","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/DevServer-swift.enum/url(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/url(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"url","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"SuperwallOptions.DevServer.url(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dev server at an exact address — the "},{"code":"Device","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" URL’s origin that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"superwall dev","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" prints, e.g. "},{"code":"http:\/\/192.168.1.10:6100","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Use this on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"physical device, which can’t reach your machine via "},{"code":"localhost","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.enum\/url(_:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}